      "html": "<p>Playground safety in a school has three tiers. The school owns two of them. The annual inspection is the one everyone remembers. The routine checks between are the ones that catch a cracked seat or a loose foundation in time. They are easy to skip. The gap shows when something breaks and nobody has a record.</p>"
